43:## Anti-Patterns
43:
43:- Single ‘goto_pose‘ across the whole scene - clips clutter. Use waypoints.
43:- Lift waypoint at same z as grasp_pos - drags the object sideways.
43:- Descending straight into a container without a rim-clearance check - grasp collides with walls.
43:- Forgetting ‘for _ in range(3): get_observation()‘ after ‘open_gripper()‘ - object doesn’t settle; next
43:     observation is stale.
43:- Using ‘goto_pose‘ in far workspace where ‘solve_ik‘+‘move_to_joints‘ is required.
