5. **Never re-dispatch completed tasks.** Completed validation tasks must not be run again, because
     duplicate trial directories can corrupt aggregate results.

### Workflow

#### 1. Read the Progress Tracker

‘‘‘bash
cat <PROGRESS_FILE>
